{"id":"auftrag","lemma":"Auftrag","pos":"noun","rank":1089,"glosses":["assignment, job, mission","order, instructions"],"ipa":"/ˈʔaʊ̯ftʁaːk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6e/De-at-Auftrag.ogg/De-at-Auftrag.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Auftrages","plural":"Aufträge"},"examples":[{"text":"Wann wirst du deinen Auftrag beenden?","en":"When will you finish your assignment?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to finish"}]},{"text":"Er führte seinen Auftrag aus.","en":"He accomplished his mission.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to lead","l":"führen"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"out of / from"}]},{"text":"Wir sind mit dem Auftrag rechtzeitig fertig geworden.","en":"We got the job done on time.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"in time"},{"g":"ready for use"},{"g":"become, got"}]},{"text":"Mein Auftrag ist es, mit Ihnen zu gehen.","en":"My orders are to go with you.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"sie"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to go, to walk"}]},{"text":"Der Auftrag dauerte länger als erwartet.","en":"That job took us longer than we expected.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to last","l":"dauern"},{"g":"long","l":"lang"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"expected, anticipated"}]}]}